{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqiu2nm5qgb","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Bench PLUMBING under-counts the always-resident MCP schema tax","summary":"MCP tool-schema tokens are cached into the system prompt and amortized across the session, NOT attributable per-message. So PLUMBING captures only tool_use/tool_result round-trips and under-counts the always-resident schema overhead. Read NET as an upper bound on work-only cost and PLUMBING as a lower bound on true orchestration overhead.","created_by":null,"valid_from":"2026-06-18T01:40:54.413Z","vec":null,"vecs":[[0.026681946590542793,-0.05722062662243843,0.049617066979408264,0.02872752584517002,0.024061519652605057,-0.051572706550359726,0.01002916507422924,0.06493894010782242,0.07389964908361435,0.03125854954123497,-0.04639018326997757,-0.009768890216946602,0.004290395881980658,-0.007167578674852848,-0.0252044927328825,-0.05061333253979683,0.08594571799039841,-0.06014932319521904,0.04296436160802841,-0.04838278517127037,0.023096846416592598,-0.0015603062929585576,-0.048828091472387314,0.02491896040737629,-0.008198472671210766,0.03885689005255699,-0.053274817764759064,-0.05344467610120773,-0.03658922389149666,0.04057731479406357,-0.06594058126211166,0.08154681324958801,-0.04745430499315262,-0.032763391733169556,0.11723659932613373,0.08627510815858841,0.021640049293637276,0.03800593316555023,-0.01909640058875084,-0.04040321335196495,-0.001510946429334581,-0.02835424430668354,0.04299439117312431,0.022653626278042793,0.028861306607723236,-0.02566811628639698,-0.03582160174846649,-0.07559983432292938,-0.10267864167690277,0.03114164248108864,-0.01401901338249445,-0.022192372009158134,0.013954391703009605,0.060188669711351395,0.06293385475873947,0.062101561576128006,-0.044227294623851776,-0.043021585792303085,-0.09366122633218765,-0.0038846563547849655,-0.09868358075618744,-0.048929985612630844,-0.04166421666741371,0.03855458274483681,0.05642951652407646,0.07635743170976639,0.05481790006160736,-0.027784237638115883,0.